Trimmed real data (ruling T1: Fontsource and jsDelivr counts are open sources;
small trimmed real fixtures are allowed). No value was altered; ids were only
removed.

- http/stats.json: 14 of the 2,120 ids of https://api.fontsource.org/v1/stats,
  as the Fontsource API served it on 2026-09-26 (fetched 01:56 UTC). The
  numbers are monthly and lifetime npm download counts (from api.npmjs.org)
  and jsDelivr CDN hit counts (from data.jsdelivr.com) that Fontsource
  aggregates per package. The Age header in http/index.json is the real
  answer's; its other headers are trimmed.
- snapshot/ is what the collector's fetch() writes from http/ on 2026-09-26;
  expected.jsonl is what its parse() returns for snapshot/. Rebuild with
  tests/collectors/fontsource_stats/build_fixture.py.

Source: Fontsource (https://fontsource.org), whose code
(https://github.com/fontsource/fontsource) is under the MIT License. Its API
states no license for the statistics, and neither does jsDelivr's data API
(docs/sources.md). No personal data: the counts are aggregates per package.
